---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { skills, links, headshot } from '../config';
import Media from '../components/Media.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Mechanical engineering student who codes, building robots from soft surgical joints to fish-robot test rigs.">
  <div class="wrap pt-12 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_20rem]">
    <div>
      <p class="mono">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">I started with code and moved toward the metal</h1>

      <div class="prose-site mt-8">
        <p>I moved from India to the US at 15 and taught myself to code by building things until they worked. That turned into three AI and ML internships before I started college.</p>
        <p>Iron Man got me into robotics. Then I found out the mechanical joint is where it gets hard, so I'm studying mechanical engineering at Kennesaw State.</p>
        <p>My labs are an experiment. Soft surgical robots, a fish robot, thermal imaging and drone sensing are all trials in finding which corner of robotics I commit to. Medical robotics leads for now.</p>
        <p>I'm looking for a summer 2027 research spot in medical robotics, or anywhere hardware meets learning. Email works best: <a href={`mailto:${links.email}`}>{links.email}</a>, or <a href={`mailto:${links.emailSchool}`}>{links.emailSchool}</a> at school.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="lg:pt-10">
      <Media kind="image" src={headshot.src || '/media/headshot.jpg'} alt={headshot.alt} ratio="4 / 5" />
      <p class="figcap">Headshot coming.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-14">Skills</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      {skills.map((g) => (
        <section class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--rule)] p-5" aria-label={g.group}>
          <h3 class="mono">{g.group}</h3>
          <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{g.items.map((i) => <li class="tag">{i}</li>)}</ul>
        </section>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
